Decisions D-001/D-002: this site is the control engine for the three
Grimaldi Engineering clusters; cluster 1 (Energy Intelligence) is
controlled here in full and leads the navigation and the home page.
The cluster-2 Palletizer product surface is unchanged (same URLs).

Data layer (single source of truth, typed):
- lib/clusters.ts: three clusters, constitution gates, rewards
- lib/energy/registry.ts: 14-repo registry from the 2026-09-05 live
  inventory (git ls-remote + clone of public hits); six statuses only;
  unlocated repos recorded as EXPERIMENT with a locate-or-strike date
- lib/energy/architecture.ts: GridOS + 9 modules, 10-stage safety chain,
  separation triggers, shared primitives with the five answers each
- lib/energy/tools.ts: 13 agent tool contracts (schema, scope, timeout,
  validation, failure behaviour); none writes a setpoint
- lib/energy/kpis.ts, decisions.ts, research.ts, intel.ts, wedge.ts

Pages: /energy + registry, decisions, kpis, architecture, safety,
agent-tools, wedge, research, intelligence (EN + DE, prerendered).
JSON: /api/energy/{index,clusters,registry,architecture,tools,kpis,
decisions,research,intelligence,wedge} — static, cached, read-only.

Site: nav spine (Energy first, Integrators folded into Palletizer),
home rebuilt around the three clusters, metadata/schema widened,
sitemap priorities, footer/header links, cluster-control CSS.
Docs: AGENTS.md, docs/energy/{MANDATE,CONSTITUTION,MIGRATION}.md.

Verified: npx tsc --noEmit clean; next build prerenders all /energy
routes and /api/energy resources; /palletizer still 200.

